cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If using this proof archive, please cite it."
title: "The Exact Five-Orbit Threshold for Short Dyadic Cycles under Free Abelian Actions"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "A finite simple graph of minimum degree at least three with a free abelian action and at most five vertex orbits contains a 4-, 8-, or 16-cycle. Six-orbit connected cubic cyclic covers can have shortest dyadic cycle exactly 32."
